Portions of Nlaser are ported from MeerK40t (https://github.com/meerk40t/meerk40t),
reference commit d511944. Each ported file carries
"SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause AND MIT" and both copyright lines.
MeerK40t is not linked or shipped; its code was translated to C++.

Ported so far:
  src/laser/ruida_codec.cpp  <- meerk40t/ruida/rdjob.py (encoders, swizzle),
                                meerk40t/ruida/udp_connection.py (_package)
  src/laser/ruida_decode.cpp <- meerk40t/ruida/rdjob.py (command constants,
                                RDJob.process)
  src/laser/ruida_encode.cpp <- meerk40t/ruida/rdjob.py (command bytes only;
                                sequence and values follow LightBurn output)
  src/laser/ruida_link.cpp   <- meerk40t/ruida/udp_connection.py (ENQ connect,
                                ACK/NAK handshake); memory addresses from
                                meerk40t/ruida/emulator.py (mem_lookup)

